# ⚡ Use Case: Spot Buying

## 📌 Business Requirement
Quick purchase from external marketplace.

---

## 🌍 Scenario
User buys item not available in catalog.

---

## 🔁 Process Flow
1. Search external marketplace  
2. Create PR  
3. Approval  
4. PO  

---

## ⚙️ System Behavior
- Integrated external buying  
- Flexible sourcing  

---

## ⚠️ Challenges
- Price variation  
- Supplier reliability  

---

## ✅ Solution
- Define policies  
- Limit usage  

---

## 🎯 Learning
Useful for flexibility but needs control.
